 "text": "Hi, how you doing right now? Roughly half of bears in yellow are actually curious children. A clear message helps parents keep kids safe. Keep a bright light on them as they sleep. Or use a flashing sign. Bears learn from seeing others run. Made the tent as big as you can make it quickly. Back up and stay still. Bears often just want check out the surprise and leave. The key is being prepared and not scaring the bear worse than it already is. Bears that have been fed at the same spot come back looking for more.",
